**Assignment No. 2: Image Rotation** 

**Problem Statement:** Write a program to read an image and rotate it in clockwise and anticlockwise direction. 

**Code** 

```scilab
img = rgb2gray(imread('./assets/lena.jpg'));
clk_angle = input("Enter an angle in degrees (for clockwise): ");
clk_img = imrotate(img, -clk_angle); 
figure(0);
subplot(2, 2, 1); title("Before Clockwise Rotation"); imshow(img);
subplot(2, 2, 2); title("After Clockwise Rotation"); imshow(clk_img);

anti_clk_angle = input("Enter an angle in degrees (for anticlockwise): ");
anti_clk_img = imrotate(img, anti_clk_angle);
subplot(2, 2, 3); title("Before Anticlockwise Rotation"); imshow(img);
subplot(2, 2, 4); title("After Anticlockwise Rotation"); imshow(anti_clk_img);

```



